                  "text": "Hag 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eikirikirie oltoilo lenye enkop ina kata apa; kake eitayio taata enkisiligata ajo, “Eton aigil ena nabo neme enkop ake aikirikirie kake o shumata sii.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
